ears in the map report. Artix-7: WNS and WHS stay positive. Simulation cannot see these: on 04/11 a ROM with three read ports lost its M4K mapping and Quartus removed the Master Core." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2937;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="760" width="570" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
